About Ogilvy &nbsp;

Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity-innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp; entertainment, PR &amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named Network of the Year at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and &nbsp; ranks &nbsp; as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world's leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel. &nbsp; For more information, visit  Ogilvy.com , and follow us on &nbsp; LinkedIn ,  X ,  Instagram , and Facebook.

&nbsp;

About WPP

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&nbsp;in a single company -&nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&nbsp; WPP.com .

&nbsp;

Business unit:  Ogilvy Advertising

Team: Account Management

Location:   Sydney

Employment type: Freelance &nbsp;

&nbsp;

We are a team of creative and strategic minds, driven by our purpose to create enduring brands and emerging ideas.

We partner with our clients to deliver strategic, creative work we are proud of.

We learn together, create together, win together, and most importantly, have fun together. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

ABOUT THE ROLE:&nbsp;

Ogilvy is looking for an experienced Account Manager or Senior Account Manager to join our Sydney team on a freelance temporary basis immediately until the end of 2026.&nbsp;

We're looking for someone who thrives in a fast-paced agency environment, loves building strong client relationships, and can confidently lead projects from briefing to delivery. You'll work across integrated campaigns alongside strategy, creative, production and specialist teams, ensuring exceptional work is delivered on time and on budget.

&nbsp;

WHAT YOU'LL DO:

• Managing day-to-day client relationships and acting as a trusted partner

• Leading integrated campaigns across multiple channels and touchpoints

• Developing project timelines, scopes, budgets and workflow plans

• Writing clear briefs and ensuring work is delivered to a high standard

• Managing stakeholder expectations and navigating competing priorities

• Identifying opportunities to grow accounts and add value for clients

&nbsp;

WHAT YOU'LL BRING:

• 2-3+ years' experience in account management within a creative, advertising, digital or integrated agency

• Strong client management and stakeholder management skills

• Excellent project management and organisational skills

• Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously

• Strong commercial acumen and attention to detail

• Experience working with creative and production teams

• A proactive, solutions-focused approach and willingness to jump in where needed

&nbsp;

At Ogilvy, inclusivity is essential to our success. We're committed to building a workplace that embraces various perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds, knowing that diverse teams drive more impactful work. &nbsp;

